#: src/Analyze/Rules/DashboardWidgetsRule.php:112
msgid "You can take any of these off the dashboard, and put them back just as easily — nothing is uninstalled and no data is touched. Debloater does not choose for you, and nothing here is preselected: which of these is worth reading is not something a plugin can work out, and the ones that look most removable are sometimes the first thing somebody checks every morning."
