msgstr ""

#: src/Analyze/Rules/RsdLinkRule.php:113
msgid "Every page carries a Really Simple Discovery link pointing at xmlrpc.php."
msgstr ""

#: src/Analyze/Rules/RsdLinkRule.php:122
msgid "RSD exists so that desktop blogging clients can find the XML-RPC endpoint on their own. Almost nobody uses those clients now, and the link is one more thing pointing at an endpoint that attracts brute-force traffic. Removing the link does not disable XML-RPC; it only stops announcing it."
msgstr ""

